+### D6 —【中/P2】测试 harness 失真：41/41 全绿但盖不住真实故障
+
+**实测**：`bun test test/plugin/vscode-notebook-tool-summary.test.ts test/plugin/vscode-bridge.test.ts` → **41 pass / 0 fail**。
